  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The works to the trees hereby approved shall only comprise the following and must be carried out in accordance with British Standard BS3998:2010\r\n\r\nThe crown reduction should be by no more than back to the most recent previous pruning points or a maximum of 30% of crown volume.\r\n\r\nNo pruning cuts are to be made which are greater than 75mm in diameter.\r\n\r\nTo prevent unnecessary loss or mutilation to the tree, in accordance with Policy OS5 of the Local Plan (2018).",
    "Condition : 2 - No less than five working days' notice shall be given to the Council's Arboricultural Officer before any work commences to the tree (Email: TreesEnquiries@lbhf.gov.uk and Telephone 020 8748 3020).\r\n\r\nTo ensure that the Council has the opportunity to confirm the tree work is carried out in accordance with Condition 1 of this permission as well as Policy OS5 of the Local Plan (2018)."
  ],
